{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sMyXeDQqtI1792736982.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西半山承德山莊分行高級資深分區營業經理周耀棠表示，分行新近促成西營盤翰林峰租賃成交，單位為5座中層B室，實用面積215平方呎，採開放式間隔，向東南，景觀開揚，望香港大學及山景，最新以1.9萬元租出，折合實用呎租約88.4元。<br/>據了解，新租客為學生，心儀單位鄰近大學、位置便利，遂決定承租。業主則於2021年以660萬元購入單位，持貨5年，是次出租可享約3.5厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:43:58.956962+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:58:10.621446+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:38:15.135044+00:00","content_hash":"ee1063f3f892549798cd5c772a6efce5ef4ebbdf6e450c51db8fb6d3a1f26b30","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:43:58.956962+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}